{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“从远处传来的旧歌”是对熟悉却无法重新握住之感的比喻，直接承接H2的亲近与失落，没有新增真实往事，也没有把音乐变化当成心理原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"自我整理、收住悲伤以及外在庄严与内在不安并存，都接在H1的收紧和H2的无从安心之上，并由M8的自我收束、秩序与克制支撑；“在记忆中走出舞步”在此是比喻，不构成真实舞蹈往事的断言。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"小节中的焦灼与呼吸只是用来对应心理状态的听感证据，真正的因果是H2中想靠近却无法安心，以及持续自持所需的用力逐渐累积，最终疲倦而问题仍未解决。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"不甘心放弃和认为这份在乎值得争取，是从H1的分量、H2逐渐清晰的靠近愿望及M6的认真承担中延伸出的局部心理动因，没有宣称新的外部行动或已经胜出的结果，也没有改变主线。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"四条都交代了当下的感受及其心理因果，即使不看具体小节和听感描述，仍能读懂他从珍惜与失落、依靠自持到感到耗力、仍不愿放弃的心理脉络。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e86c5d0f-1bad-4cd7-bd6d-be3e09646fb7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T135039857921Z", "elapsed_seconds": 330.031, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:56:09.894092+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "803a51e1ae5f7d2cc100fa3ba2337b169312f3a6685f976907b15a324fea3d42", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": f